  "title": "Country Fried Steak and Milk Gravy",
  "description": "This fried cube steak is cooked in lard until golden brown and crisp, then served with a peppery pan gravy for a simple dinner ready in 30 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "LIKESTOCOOK"
  ],
