  "ingredients": [
    "4 (4 ounce) cube steaks",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt, divided",
    "1.75 teaspoons ground black pepper, divided",
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "2 eggs, lightly beaten",
    "0.25 cup lard",
    "1 cup milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FUPH5p5kjzHDzhNbl8t6iWwFrgA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-30693-country-fried-steak-and-milk-gravy-ddmfs-step1-3x4-2121c34bb98947c68c9b3233c8cd7709.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/30693/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season steaks with 1/4 teaspoon salt and 1/4 teaspoon pepper; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mCSWqJRQNu72lvVTRqZeR0jUct4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-30693-country-fried-steak-and-milk-gravy-ddmfs-step2-3x4-272ea290751b45b5953147a95885102c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/30693/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour and 1 teaspoon pepper in a shallow plate. Place beaten eggs in a shallow bowl. Dredge seasoned steaks in flour. Dip in eggs, then dredge in flour again.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VGAgQzPVnv3GVBoYSkZNFL-OU2w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-30693-country-fried-steak-and-milk-gravy-ddmfs-step3-3x4-8af226e678774a6787b368aea6a31417.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/30693/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat lard in a large, heavy skillet over medium-high heat. Fry steaks in hot lard until golden brown, 3 to 4 minutes per side. Drain on a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1Qp1ptgzA3S4c3K0Juf_QEyScqs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-30693-country-fried-steak-and-milk-gravy-ddmfs-step4-3x4-de94a2203eda4c149d146f131285ef2a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/30693/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour off all but 2 tablespoons fat from the skillet. Sprinkle 2 tablespoons dredging flour into fat. Cook and stir over medium heat for 1 minute, scraping up any browned bits from the bottom of the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FPT7aauG1Ja54bHAkc323EFYvWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-30693-country-fried-steak-and-milk-gravy-ddmfs-step5-3x4-fce9f35631bf40eca761eb25e4594076.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/30693/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually whisk in milk. Cook, whisking frequently, until gravy is thickened and bubbly, 3 to 4 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wMx48ob5N1I8O0ISy4B_K24Pfj8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-30693-country-fried-steak-and-milk-gravy-ddmfs-step6-3x4-2ae6e69cad8e455c90c6fedef1d3994d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/30693/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in remaining 1/4 teaspoon salt and 1/2 teaspoon pepper; gravy should be quite peppery. Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HaTdxDei3tkV36zcavt_dcIIVz8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-30693-country-fried-steak-and-milk-gravy-ddmfs-3x4-885395702a274c0b8f6ce46b62759efd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/30693/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
